        "Sin JIT, Dreamcast necesita «Flycast (sin JIT)», que aún no está en esta compilación. Abre OmniStation con JIT o compila ese núcleo.": "Without JIT, Dreamcast needs “Flycast (no JIT)”, which is not in this build yet. Open OmniStation with JIT or build that core.",
        "No queda JIT permanente libre (lo ocupa otro emulador): este juego va sin JIT. Cierra y abre OmniStation para recuperarlo.": "No permanent JIT left (another emulator holds it): this game runs without JIT. Close and reopen OmniStation to get it back.",
        "%@ %@ disponible. El núcleo integrado se actualiza con la próxima versión de OmniStation: iOS no deja que una app cambie su propio código.": "%@ %@ is available. The built-in core is updated with the next OmniStation version: iOS doesn't let an app change its own code.",
